OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny mist and fog quite slow to
OL,6,Fclear in the morning. Then a largely
OL,7,Fdry day with bright or sunny spells
OL,8,Fdeveloping. The odd shower around the
OL,9,Fcoast, mainly for counties Antrim and
OL,10,FDown.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FVariable cloud in the east
OL,13,Fwith the odd coastal shower possible.
OL,14,FOtherwise dry with clear spells
OL,15,Fallowing fog to form again overnight
OL,16,Fand perhaps the odd touch of rural
OL,17,Ffrost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
