OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FAgain fog may be quite slow to
OL,6,Fclear in the morning. Otherwise a dry
OL,7,Fday with variable cloud and bright or
OL,8,Fsunny spells.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,11,Fstart Tuesday, cloudier later with
OL,12,Fsome outbreaks of rain and freshening
OL,13,Fwinds, this gradually clearing through
OL,14,FWednesday. Dry but cooler on Thursday
OL,15,Fwith variable cloud and bright spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
